WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.675
Disgusting garbage piled up on top of Roxy.

2
00:00:03.676 --> 00:00:07.468
"Yuck!" Roxy wiped moldy tomato sauce off her face.

3
00:00:07.469 --> 00:00:09.910
"This is gross! Bleck!"

4
00:00:09.911 --> 00:00:12.664
Roxy pushed garbage away from herself.

5
00:00:12.665 --> 00:00:15.198
More garbage fell down onto her.

6
