9
00:00:23.809 --> 00:00:26.550
Roxy quickly burst out of the pile.

10
00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:29.791
She watched the fire burn up all the trash.

11
00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:33.547
"Now I have to find Trashman," Roxy thought.

12
00:00:33.548 --> 00:00:37.185
She flew out of the building and up into the sky.

13
00:00:37.186 --> 00:00:40.860
Looking down, she saw police cars chasing a garbage truck.

14
00:00:40.861 --> 00:00:46.506
"That's Trashman!" Roxy shot after the truck. Trashman

15
00:00:46.507 --> 00:00:48.655
saw the police cars. "It's

16
00:00:48.656 --> 00:00:52.409
time for one of my garbage bombs!" He

17
00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.885
pushed a button. A

18
00:00:54.886 --> 00:00:59.935
huge ball of garbage fired out from the back of the truck. Ka-boom! The

19
00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:01.594
garbage exploded. The

20
00:01:01.595 --> 00:01:03.683
police cars crashed. "Ha-ha!"

21
00:01:03.684 --> 00:01:07.505
Trashman's messy hair waved wildly. "Ahugh!

22
00:01:07.506 --> 00:01:11.382
Ahugh! Ha-ha!" "Trashman

23
00:01:11.383 --> 00:01:14.644
is terrible!" Roxy thought. "He

24
00:01:14.645 --> 00:01:18.292
doesn't just steal—he litters too!" Ka-boom!

25
00:01:18.293 --> 00:01:24.247
Ka-boom! More garbage bombs exploded. An

26
00:01:24.248 --> 00:01:26.784
old, ripped sock landed on a man's head. He

27
00:01:26.785 --> 00:01:31.005
shook his fist at the garbage truck. "Litterbug!" Roxy

28
