30
00:01:40.673 --> 00:01:45.823
Roxy wiped her face. Suddenly— snap!

31
00:01:45.824 --> 00:01:48.089
The truck's claw grabbed Roxy.

32
00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:51.510
Roxy struggled, but the claw squeezed more tightly.

33
00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.755
Finally Roxy twisted with all her might.

34
00:01:54.756 --> 00:01:58.790
The truck flipped onto its side and slid to a stop.

35
