37
00:02:07.772 --> 00:02:10.675
Roxy used her super strength.

38
00:02:10.676 --> 00:02:14.147
Slowly she forced the claw to open.

39
00:02:14.148 --> 00:02:22.296
With one tug, she ripped it from the truck.

40
00:02:22.297 --> 00:02:25.472
Zoom! She shot after Trashman.

41
00:02:25.473 --> 00:02:29.175
Snap! Roxy caught the villain with the claw.

42
00:02:29.176 --> 00:02:31.882
Roxy grinned. "Got you!"

43
00:02:31.883 --> 00:02:34.428
Trashman groaned.

44
00:02:34.429 --> 00:02:38.078
Then he started to cough.

45
00:02:38.079 --> 00:02:45.264
Roxy brought him to jail.

46
